Commits referenced:
  1e8d8cde5bfa  Improvement: The auto-renaming of newly created files/folders now happens onCreation instead of in multiple places. This solves multiple cases where creating files caused problems.
  c0f5be7d77bb  Modified path uniqueness contraint for AbstractFiles to be configurable via structr.conf
  52fa03f09ffc  changed signature for onModification so that we get information about the modifications.
  345f689a5ccd  auto-append the current date/time to uploads if the filename would clash otherwise
  14cfea3836e5  created a uniqueness constraint on AbstractFile (see https://github.com/structr/structr/issues/158)

commit c0f5be7d77bb51a61cf5745f43be907a197aae98
Date: Fri Jan 22 13:58:20 2016 +0100

Modified path uniqueness contraint for AbstractFiles to be configurable via structr.conf using application.filesystem.unique.paths.


